n of terror. With great courage and determination, he did not only lead and defeated the Dark Elf Encroach at the famous battle of Solkai. He had also beaten Varamos himself in a one-on-one duel, slaying the dark lord and avenging Newheart's family. Newheart and his companions would go on to become legends, with Newheart granted the title of ‘Protector of the Realm’ by the late King Lorencius, and bestowed numerous titles and land.\n\n    This overview, dear viewer, is but a fraction of Newheart’s story. You can find more books on Newhearts' adventures at your local library, including his defeat of the rebel Orc leader: Kaliban O’ Nok!"

