    # game/strings/Books.rpy:63
    old "      {i}In restless slumber, the great Astatar sleeps softly beneath the blackest waves.{/i}\n\n    Before the first men, before we joined {color=#fff185}our hands{/color} with the new gods, Astatar, amongst the old gods, existed when the world was but only a dream - a whisper.\n\n    A titan amongst the old gods, anointed by Malakai, the great deceiver, he served only his dark master's call. It is said Astatar now rests, awaiting the return of his master to once again take flesh. So they might at last finish their great and terrible purpose.\n\n{i}V.C{/i}"
    new "{i}Em sono inquieto, o grande Astatar dorme suavemente sob as ondas mais negras.{/i}"

